    <tags>office-addins, auth</tags>
    <rigor-hint>FULL</rigor-hint>
    <rigor-reason>Migrates the Outlook add-in off deprecated auth services onto the canonical NAA strategy, converges two mismatched manifests, and removes a hardcoded org URL. Auth-surface change with real security + deployment impact; `office-addins` + `auth` tags trigger FULL rigor; must respect ADR-028 (no self-built credential; `OfficeNaaStrategy` only). Uses the `office-addins-deploy` skill for build/deploy.</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>W7</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Touches `src/client/office-addins/` only (client TS + manifests) — disjoint from BFF W7 tasks. Blocks task 074 (which adds Association Engine suggestions to the same save pane).</parallel-reason>
