  <steps>
    <step order="1" name="Context check">Check context usage; handoff + stop if &gt; 70%.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Load knowledge">Read spec FR-25, ADR-028, the sso-binding pattern, and `office-addins-deploy` skill. Confirm `OfficeNaaStrategy` is present on `master`; consult `researcher` for current unified-manifest + NAA specifics if stale.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Audit deprecated auth">Grep the add-in for `NaaAuthService`, `DialogAuthService`, `authConfig` consumers; catalog each call site.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Migrate to OfficeNaaStrategy">Replace each deprecated call site with `@spaarke/auth` `OfficeNaaStrategy` / `authenticatedFetch`. Remove the deprecated services once no consumer remains.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Unify manifest">Reconcile the XML (v1.0.19) and JSON (devPreview v1.0.0) manifests onto a single unified JSON manifest; reconcile version + capabilities; retire the divergent manifest.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Org-URL fix">Replace the hardcoded `spaarkedev1.crm.dynamics.com` with an environment-tokenized config value; grep to confirm no literal remains.</step>
    <step order="7" name="Build + deploy">Build the add-in; deploy to dev via the `office-addins-deploy` skill (SWA CLI).</step>
    <step order="8" name="Smoke test">Smoke-test the save flow in dev under NAA end-to-end (sign-in, save action reaches the BFF). Record the result.</step>
    <step order="9.5" name="FULL quality gates">Invoke `code-review` on the diff; invoke `adr-check` against spec.md (ADR-028; NFR-03). Address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="10" name="Update tracking">Mark task 072 ✅ in `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`; confirm task 074 dependency satisfied.</step>
    <step order="11" name="Reset state">Update `current-task.md`: status → completed; advance; record decisions.</step>
  </steps>

